                                                                                                    
  Usage: bab l [OPTIONS]                                                                            
                                                                                                    
  Options                                                                                           
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  
       --jobid           TEXT                 pick one dev job by id                                
       --wait                                 wait until the job is RUNNING                         
       --timeout         INTEGER              max seconds to wait (with --wait)                     
       --poll-interval   FLOAT RANGE [x>=1]   seconds between checks while waiting [default=5.0]    
       --srun                                 use srun --overlap instead of ssh (keeps the job's    
                                              GPU setup)                                            
       --command         TEXT                 run a command instead of opening a shell              
  -h   --help                                 Show this message and exit.                           
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
